The Precedent Retrieval Agent serves as an intelligent legal research tool that identifies past judgments, case laws, and settlement templates relevant to the dispute or insolvency context. It connects to databases such as IBBI orders, NCLT/NCLAT rulings, and commercial court archives to find comparable precedents. This helps professionals analyze how similar cases were resolved, providing guidance on likely outcomes and acceptable terms under the IBC framework.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761649179;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761649179;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:74:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:decision_support:precedent_retrieval_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1216;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}